<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="10bbae9f">The exit criteria for each test phase will be defined in the test strategy. Each exit criteria item will be validated
against the actual data or testing task result.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
The following are exit criteria items to evaluate:&lt;br /&gt;
• Test execution &amp;gt; X% &lt;br /&gt;
• Test cases passed &amp;gt;Y%&lt;br /&gt;
• Number of open defects by severity&lt;br /&gt;
• All open defects are reviewed and signed off by the business team&lt;br /&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="externalId" nodeId="8300e1d4"></attribute>
<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="4dd9de7b"></attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="f927ad2e"></attribute>
<attribute name="purpose" nodeId="557f9037">To validate that the exit criteria defined in the test strategy is met and the test execution completion&amp;nbsp;can be signed
off and further testing started or test closure performed.</attribute>
